  "zh": "# 郑钦文美网逆转晋级16强，德国私人火箭首入轨道\n## 体育与社会\n- **郑钦文逆转晋级美网16强**：0-5落后翻盘，下轮迎战斯瓦泰克看点拉满。\n- **江西遂川泥石流致2死10失联**：突发自然灾害救援正在进行，失联人员安危牵动人心。\n- **央视曝光幽灵外卖**：无实体店却能上线外卖平台，食品安全监管漏洞亟待填补。\n## 科技与行业\n- **阿里巴巴前高管在美确认身亡**：失踪多日后确认死讯，引发科技圈广泛关注。\n- **AI能否设计电路板探讨**：大模型在硬件工程领域的实际应用能力仍面临巨大挑战。\n- **Chrome再次豁免谷歌数据设置**：浏览器巨头被指在隐私规则上偏袒自家产品，引发争议。\n## 国际视野\n- **德国私人火箭首次进入轨道**：Isar Aerospace从欧洲本土发射成功，打破欧洲航天僵局。\n- **南非钻石矿因人造钻石关闭**：实验室培育钻石冲击传统矿业，南非经济面临新挑战。",
  "en": "# Zheng Qinwen advances at US Open, German private rocket reaches orbit.\n## Sports & Society\n- **Zheng Qinwen US Open 4th Round**: Stunning 0-5 comeback keeps Chinese tennis hopes alive.\n- **Jiangxi Suichuan Mudslide**: Rescue underway after disaster leaves 2 dead and 10 missing.\n- **CCTV Exposes Ghost Takeout**: Fake restaurants on delivery apps highlight food safety loopholes.\n## Tech & Industry\n- **Alibaba Exec Confirmed Dead**: Missing former executive found dead in US, sparking tech concern.\n- **AI Circuit Board Design**: New study explores whether LLMs can handle complex hardware tasks.\n- **Chrome Exempts Google Data Rules**: Browser giant faces criticism for bypassing its own privacy settings.\n## Global Vision\n- **German Private Rocket Reaches Orbit**: Isar Aerospace makes history with successful European launch.\n- **South African Diamond Mines Close**: Lab-grown stones crush traditional mining sales, threatening economy."
